description:
The shadow oracle recorded "success" on #2761's final head c8e7f2017 from a Codex review that read no files (file-list brief, summary saying it could not review). The pull request merged into develop as 47ee38575 on a stand-in comment of 293 characters with no review text. The hollow-review scan on 2026-10-08 flagged it, and the handoff required a re-review before the cut-over, but the merge came first. Its soundness-path changes therefore never had a real oracle review.

Scope of the review: the nine soundness-path files changed in 47ee38575 (+224/-61):
- five files under _project/scripts/explorer_pipeline/ (models.py, pipeline.py, ranking.py, transformer.py, duckdb_builder.py);
- publication/ledger-seed.json;
- scripts/generate_corpus_inventory.py;
- scripts/publication/check_explorer_compat.py;
- _project/scripts/results_explorer_snapshot_invariants.py.
The other files in the commit (corpus bundles, tests, docs, results-explorer sources) are outside the soundness list and need no oracle review.
